@startuml sequence_mode_toggle
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Mode toggle Live -> Review (no tile remount)

actor User
participant "DashboardPage" as Page
participant "TileContext\n(per tile)" as Ctx
participant "PluginTile" as Tile
participant "TileController" as Ctrl
participant "API" as API
database "SQL" as DB

User -> Page: Click "Review" pill
Page -> Page: mode.set('review')
Ctx -> Ctx: mode() emits 'review'
note over Tile: bindTileMode effect fires
Tile -> Ctrl: load('review', selectedReviewDate)
Ctrl -> API: GET /resource?asOf=<date>
API -> DB: SELECT aggregate WHERE profile=:p AND date<=:asOf
DB --> API: rows
API --> Ctrl: { mode:'review', asOf, data }
Ctrl --> Tile: signal updates
Tile -> Tile: pill swaps LIVE -> REVIEW\nsame DOM host, same instanceId
Tile --> User: Body re-renders with historical value

@enduml
